  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 811.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to set forth the licensing requirements for all end stage renal disease dialysis centers (ESRDDC) pursuant to RSA 151:2, I(d).\n\nSource. #5600, eff 3-24-93, EXPIRED: 3-24-99\n\nNew. #9963, eff 7-28-11; ss by #12827, INTERIM, eff 7-20-19, EXPIRED: 1-16-20\n\nNew. #12985, eff 1-29-20; ss by #14206, eff 2-28-25",
